-Unique `(tenant_id,candidate_id,idempotency_key)` on each ledger gives replay identity. Same key
-plus different hash is `409 idempotency_conflict`. A succeeded row returns the
-same result. A failed retry may re-drive only codes classified retryable. The
-candidate terminal compare-and-set decides Add-vs-Dismiss races; one wins and the
